data: {"id": "6a3adae5155f476f-thinking-parallel_evidence-1206", "run_id": "6a3adae5155f476f", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 已采集事实\n\n### 1. Pod 状态与事件 (kubectl_describe)\n- **Phase**: `Pending`, `nodeName: <none>` — Pod 未分配到任何节点。\n- **Conditions**: `PodScheduled=False`, reason=`Unschedulable`, message=`0/3 nodes are available: 3 node(s) didn't match Pod's node affinity/selector`.\n- **Events**: 多次 `FailedScheduling` 事件，原因均为 **\"3 node(s) didn't match Pod's node affinity/selector\"**。\n\n### 2. Pod 规格 (kubectl_get_yaml)\n- **nodeSelector**: `aiops.lab/unavailable=true`\n- **Tolerations**: 仅有 `node.kubernetes.io/not-ready:NoExe", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789037649406, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

