data: {"id": "6a3adae5155f476f-final", "run_id": "6a3adae5155f476f", "seq": 1211, "ts_ms": 1789037664234, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-01/workload-68c557d875-gtzc8` | Pending | Pod aiops-case-01/workload-68c557d875-gtzc8 持续处于 Pending 状态，未分配到任何节点 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | default-scheduler | `0/3 nodes are available: 3 node(s) didn't match Pod's node affinity/selector` | 揭示调度失败直接原因：节点亲和性/选择器不匹配 |\n| 2 | K8s Config | resource_request.cpu | `5m` | 排除资源超卖/资源不足导致的调度阻塞 |\n| 3 | K8s Config | resource_request.memory | `8Mi` | 排除资源超卖/资源不足导致的调度阻塞 |\n| 4 | K8s State | pod.condition | `PodScheduled=False; Reason=Unschedulable` | 确认 Pod 处于调度失败状态 |\n| 5 | Metric | prometheus | `kube_pod_status_phase` Pending: `1` | 从监控维度佐证 Pod 持续处于 Pending 状态 |\n\n证据说明：\n- 调度事件 (#1) 与 Pod 状态 (#4) 强一致，均指向节点选择器（Node Affinity/Selector）不匹配。\n- 容器资源请求量极低 (#2, #3)，排除了资源配额导致调度失败的可能，佐证了问题在于标签/亲和性配置。\n- 监控数据 (#5) 从时间维度持续验证了 Pod 的 Pending 现象，未见状态变化。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n```text\nPod 定义包含 nodeSelector: aiops.lab/unavailable=true → 调度器发现集群中 3/3 节点均无此标签 → 触发 FailedScheduling 事件 → Pod 保持 Pending 状态 (nodeName=<none>)\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n已确认根因为 **Pod 选择器配置与节点标签不匹配**。Pod 声明了 `nodeSelector: aiops.lab/unavailable=true`，但集群所有节点（共 3 个）均未设置该标签，导致调度器无法找到任何可用节点（0/3 nodes are available）。证据 (#1, #4) 明确支持该结论。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.0m\n├─ 问题定位: 15.5s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 39.6s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-01/workload-68c557d875-gtzc8: 39.6s (Evidence 31.7s, RCA 7.7s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 6.9s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-01/workload-68c557d875-gtzc8**: pod-pending-unschedulable\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 61.984, "metrics": {"run_id": "6a3adae5155f476f", "mttr": {"value": "1.0m", "seconds": 61.990299224853516, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "48%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-pending-unschedulable", "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "完整因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-pending-unschedulable"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 61990.299224853516, "llm_calls": 9, "llm_duration_ms": 58285.50863265991, "tool_calls": 10, "executed_tool_calls": 10, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 0, "successful_tool_calls": 10, "failed_tool_calls": 0, "tool_duration_ms": 9986.838579177856, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 3403.162717819214}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 15450.976848602295, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "duration_ms": 39582.690954208374, "success": true}, "evidence": {"name": "evidence", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "rca": {"name": "rca", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "conclusion": {"name": "汇总总结", "duration_ms": 6936.21039390564, "success": true}}, "success": true, "errors": []}}

